; Coverage for textual_xacts.cc: an `=` after a posting's amount
; expression or cost expression begins a balance assertion.  Both
; expressions are parsed with PARSE_SINGLE, which stops at the closing
; parenthesis, so the expression parser never reads the `=`.

2024/01/01 Opening
    Assets:Cash    = $100.00
    Equity:Opening

2024/01/02 Deposit
    Assets:Cash    ($50.00 * 2) = $200.00
    Equity:Opening

2024/01/03 Broker
    Assets:Brokerage    10 AAPL @ ($500.00 / 10) = 10 AAPL
    Assets:Cash

test bal
            $-300.00
             10 AAPL  Assets
             10 AAPL    Brokerage
            $-300.00    Cash
            $-200.00  Equity:Opening
--------------------
            $-500.00
             10 AAPL
end test
